<!doctype html><html lang="tr"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Site içerikleri</title><style>body{font-family:system-ui;background:#f5f7f5;color:#26332b;margin:0}.wrap{max-width:850px;margin:35px auto;padding:0 20px}.panel{background:white;padding:26px;border-radius:16px}label{display:block;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin:17px 0}input,textarea{display:block;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:12px;border:1px solid #dfe6e0;border-radius:9px;margin-top:7px;font:inherit}textarea{min-height:90px}.btn{background:#176b50;color:white;border:0;border-radius:9px;padding:13px 20px;font-weight:750}</style></head><body><main class="wrap"><h1>Web sitesi içerikleri</h1><p>Ana sayfa başlıklarını, açıklamaları ve site adını buradan düzenleyebilirsiniz.</p><form method="post" action="/admin/content"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<?= e(csrf_token()) ?>"><div class="panel"><?php foreach($contentFields as $key=>$label): ?><label><?= e($label) ?><?php if(in_array($key,['home_subtitle','featured_subtitle','footer_text'],true)): ?><textarea name="content[<?= e($key) ?>]"><?= e($content[$key]??'') ?></textarea><?php else: ?><input name="content[<?= e($key) ?>]" value="<?= e($content[$key]??'') ?>"><?php endif; ?></label><?php endforeach; ?><button class="btn" type="submit">İçerikleri kaydet</button></div></form><p><a href="/admin">← Yönetim paneli</a></p></main></body></html>